# This snippet diverts the protected paths to the "tps" service, which presents
# a Turnstile challenge designed to prevent bot traffic.
#
# Usage:
#
# - Copy this into the caddy-conf volume (modify @protected if desired)
# - Copy bot-protection.server.caddyfile into the caddy-conf volume
# - Enable the "tps" compose service
# - Restart the "web" service
#
# See docs/install/bot-protection.md for bot protection details.

@protected path /data/* /search/*
handle @protected {
  reverse_proxy tps:8080
}
